<p class="meta" id="leave-note"><strong>About "Quick exit":</strong> it opens a weather site, and on a keyboard you can also press Shift three times. It does not erase your history. If someone may check your phone, use a private window or clear this page from your history. The National Domestic Violence Hotline has <a href="https://www.thehotline.org/plan-for-safety/internet-safety/">internet safety tips</a>.</p>
